   "updated": 1717000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "t973392648",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 80.0,
   "y": 890.0,
   "width": 1419.6,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#22C55E",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "With no network, two of the three doors still open. The closed one is SHOWN, disabled, with its reason \u2014 hiding it would make the player think Zerado cannot connect to stores at all.",
