   "y": 1078,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#94A3B8",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "How a player gets from an empty machine to a library. First run is a route, not a wizard that owns the session - every door lands on a normal screen.",
